# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

maps is project
maps purpose "Count words in a map and keep records by name in another; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
maps target console
maps version "0.1.0"
maps language refined 1
maps standardLibrary 1
maps allows write console.stdout none
maps requires none
maps includesModule maps
maps entry maps.main
